## Critical Gotchas (Agent-Discovered Patterns — Do Not Repeat)

**Cross-module ACL**: `ir.model.access.csv` rows must live in the SAME module that defines the model. Foreign model reference needs `other_module.model_plasticos_x` prefix.

**SQL VIEW timing**: If `init()` references columns added by the same install, they don't exist yet. Use `make update m=<module>` immediately after first install to rebuild.

**`res_users` has no `name` column** — join `res_partner rp ON rp.id = u.partner_id` for display names.

**Selection with variable reference** — `fields.Selection(MY_CONSTANT)` only works if `MY_CONSTANT` is defined in the SAME file. See `83-ci-phantom-enum`.

**`ruff format` manifests** — `__manifest__.py` is a Python dict. Always run `ruff format` after editing it or CI will fail on format check.

**pytest-timeout version** — `2.4.0` is current. `4.3.0` does not exist on PyPI.

**Phantom enum false positives** — image formats (`png`, `jpg`), LLM providers (`openai`, `anthropic`), web form parser keys (`drum`, `tote`) are in `GLOBAL_ALLOWLIST`. Add new non-enum dispatch strings there, not as Selection values.

